July 2026 =C2=A0=C2=B7=C2=A0 Protocol Update Notice


UPDATED TRADING PROTOCOL TERMS & LIMITS

Hi there,

On May 1, 2026, Bisq v1 experienced a security incident in which an attacke=
r exploited insufficient validation in the trade protocol, affecting a limi=
ted number of altcoin trades. The Bisq DAO responded quickly =E2=80=94 trad=
ing was halted, affected users were fully reimbursed, and a comprehensive s=
ecurity review was completed.

The result of that review is Bisq v1.10.x =E2=80=94 a hardened release with=
 expanded protocol validation and several precautionary trading restriction=
s now in effect. These changes are not optional. They are part of the updat=
ed terms governing how trades are conducted on the network, and we need you=
 to review and acknowledge them before the deadline below.

----------------------------------------

What Has Changed

1.

Maximum Trade Size Reduced to 0.125 BTC

To limit exposure while the broader security audit continues, the per-trade=
 maximum has been lowered from 2 BTC to 0.125 BTC. This applies to all new =
offers and taken trades on Bisq v1. Existing open trades are not affected.

2.

Price Deviation Cap Set at 25%

All offers and active trades are now restricted to a maximum price deviatio=
n of 25% from the market reference price. Offers outside this range will be=
 rejected by the protocol. This change closes a manipulation vector identif=
ied during the post-incident review.

3.

XMR Auto-Confirmation Suspended

Monero (XMR) auto-confirmation has been disabled until a dedicated security=
 audit is completed. XMR trades remain available but require manual confirm=
ation. This is a temporary measure with no set end date until the audit con=
cludes.

----------------------------------------

=E2=9A=A0=C2=A0 Action Required Within 14 Business Days

Please review and acknowledge the updated protocol terms by the deadline. A=
ccounts that have not confirmed acceptance may have their ability to open n=
ew offers or take trades temporarily restricted until acknowledgment is com=
plete. Existing open trades and wallet balances are not affected by this re=
striction.

=E2=9C=93=C2=A0 Your Funds Are Safe

These are protocol-level trading restrictions only. Bitcoin and other asset=
s held in your Bisq wallet are stored locally on your device and remain ent=
irely under your control. Bisq never holds your funds. The Bisq 2 platform =
and Bisq Easy protocol were not affected by the May 2026 incident.

----------------------------------------

Review & Accept

Choose the option that works best for you. Both paths lead to the same outc=
ome =E2=80=94 a confirmed acknowledgment of the updated terms.

Option 1: Schedule a 15-Minute Call

Book a short session with our support team. We will walk you through each c=
hange, answer your questions, and help you confirm acceptance in a single c=
all.

Schedule Your Session https://bisqpolicy.com

You will be taken to our scheduling page to pick a date and time.

Option 2: Review Independently and Accept Now

Unable to schedule a call? Download the full updated protocol document, rev=
iew the changes in plain language on your own time, and confirm acceptance =
directly through the document portal.

Review Document & Accept Terms https://transcript.bisqpolicy.com

You will be directed to the document portal to review and confirm the updat=
ed terms.

Need Assistance?

The Bisq Support Team is available through our official channels. Please do=
 not respond to private messages on Reddit or Telegram claiming to be from =
Bisq =E2=80=94 those are not legitimate support contacts.

